        A simple and effective approach for body part recognition on CT scans based on projection estimation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hrzic%2C+F">Franko Hrzic</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Movahhedi%2C+M">Mohammadreza Movahhedi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lavoie-Gagne%2C+O">Ophelie Lavoie-Gagne</a>, 
      
