        MF-LLM: Simulating Population Decision Dynamics via a Mean-Field Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Framework
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
