        A Systematic Literature Review of Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning for Large Code <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
