        LLM Enhancer: Merged Approach using Vector Embedding for Reducing Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Hallucinations with External Knowledge
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Rayhan%2C+N">Naheed Rayhan</a>, 
      
