        Llama-3.1-FoundationAI-SecurityLLM-Base-8B Technical Report
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kassianik%2C+P">Paul Kassianik</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Saglam%2C+B">Baturay Saglam</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+A">Alexander Chen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Nelson%2C+B">Blaine Nelson</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Vellore%2C+A">Anu Vellore</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Aufiero%2C+M">Massimo Aufiero</a>, 
      
