        Towards Understanding the Nature of Attention with Low-Rank Sparse Decomposition
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=He%2C+Z">Zhengfu He</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+J">Junxuan Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lin%2C+R">Rui Lin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ge%2C+X">Xuyang Ge</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shu%2C+W">Wentao Shu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tang%2C+Q">Qiong Tang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+J">Junping Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Qiu%2C+X">Xipeng Qiu</a>
      
