    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        CoCo-Bench: A Comprehensive Code Benchmark For Multi-task Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Evaluation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yin%2C+W">Wenjing Yin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sun%2C+T">Tianze Sun</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yu%2C+Y">Yijiong Yu</a>, 
      
